t{ apartments} \\times 3 \\text{ collections/week} = 3120 \\text{ collections}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Calculate total earnings per week**\n\nJohn is paid **$0.40 per collection**.\n\n$$\n3120 \\text{ collections} \\times 0.40 = 1248 \\text{ dollars}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{1248}\n$$\n\nJohn makes **$1248** in a week.", "decode_seconds": 3.408918630797416, "draft_calls": 93, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 100, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "b4562dc664748ec2da6e0f1ccac13820bfd0fa9c413a7a3235ebec5f1d84b613", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "ad00ba13b7576269a59d5cd9c6a055f0d37ae02d5120db6053d03455132c35c4", "output_tokens": 446, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 18577908224, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 18809356288, "problem_id": "gsm8k/26c65d311a4dbe80", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 519.7100138664246, "prefill_full_target": 32.68016052246094, "prefill_relay": 0.23836800456047058, "relay": 24.91545605659485, "unattributed_runtime": 36.19398543983698, "verification_full_target": 2829.9377250671387}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "1248", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 3.4436757089570165, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 18809356288, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 18805161984, "target_calls": 93, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.032962274737656116, "turn_index": 0}
