120 \\text{ collections}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Calculate total earnings per week**\n\nJohn is paid **$0.40 per collection**.\n\n$$\n3120 \\text{ collections} \\times 0.40 = 1248 \\text{ dollars}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{1248}\n$$\n\nJohn makes **$1248** in a week.", "decode_seconds": 3.044120764825493, "draft_calls": 84, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 100, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "d1f7ef8ff1f31ac794bb462df4653f71df803c9d4d99cc25c263394e8288eed5", "method": "relay_last2", "output_hash": "ad00ba13b7576269a59d5cd9c6a055f0d37ae02d5120db6053d03455132c35c4", "output_tokens": 446, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 18577533440, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 18811453440, "problem_id": "gsm8k/26c65d311a4dbe80", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 455.39523124694824, "prefill_full_target": 32.5643196105957, "prefill_relay": 0.10521599650382996, "relay": 17.926208034157753, "unattributed_runtime": 34.878620248287916, "verification_full_target": 2537.752941131592}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "1248", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 3.0786225362680852, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 18811453440, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 18809356288, "target_calls": 84, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.0327118169516325, "turn_index": 0}
